let __v_739 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"I'm sorry you are facing this. The waiting is the hardest part of it: ask the doctors what to expect and what will keep them comfortable, say what you would regret not saying, and let people help you - this is not a thing to carry on your own.\",\"I'm sorry. Being there is most of it: sit with them, keep the room calm, and let them talk about it or not. Ask about the pain relief and who you ring at night, so you know what to do when the time comes.\",\"I'm sorry. Spend the time on what they want rather than on what you think you should be doing. Tell the people around you what is happening - you will need them, and most of them will want to help.\",\"I'm sorry. Ask the doctor to explain what the next few weeks look like, in plain words, and write it down - it is hard to hold in your head. Then let the rest go and be with them.\"]}")?;
