let __v_740 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"I'm sorry the time is coming. Make the days they have left good ones: their favourite food and company, their usual routine as far as they can still enjoy it. Ask the vet what will keep them comfortable and what the last day will be like - knowing that is what makes it bearable.\",\"I'm sorry. The waiting is the hard part now: ask the vet to walk you through the day itself before it comes, so nothing about it is a surprise, and spend the time you have with them.\",\"I'm sorry you are facing this. Say the things you want to say while they can still hear them, spoil them a little, and be there at the end if you can bear it - most people are glad they were. Tell the vet now that you want to be there, so nobody has to ask you on the day.\",\"I'm sorry. You are doing the last kind thing for them, and a day too early is kinder than a day too late. Keep them comfortable and close, and tell the vet you want each step explained before it happens.\"]}")?;
